"""
tests/test_consolidator.py
==========================
Auto Stock ML/RL Trader — Milestone 3 (R3) Data Consolidation & Pipeline Test Suite.

4-Tier Test Architecture:
- Tier 1: Functional Unit Tests (PIT merge_asof, dynamic valuation features, ZSTD Parquet I/O, Pipeline run/batch)
- Tier 2: Boundary & Error Defense Tests (Empty inputs, negative EPS / deficit, trading halt, pre-announcement, auto directory creation)
- Tier 3: Integration & Interaction Tests (MockKiwoom + MockPrice full flow, cross-validation status propagation, symbol isolation)
- Tier 4: Real-World Scenarios (Samsung 005930, SK Hynix 000660 turnaround, ZSTD compression efficiency)
"""

